   - Install Node.js and npm (Node Package Manager) on your computer.
   - Create a new directory for your project and navigate to it in the terminal.
   - Initialize a new Node.js project using the command `npm init`.
   - Install the required packages:
     - For Amazon web services integration:
     ```
     npm install amazon-web-services
     ```
     - For pricing logic:
     ```
     npm install amazon-web-services-pricing
     ```
